    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > following the main character Canaly after mysterious events happen across a world she's investigating, she stumbles upon an artifact that allows her to summon strange defense mechanisms that may help her complete this journey.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete missions</strong> as you defend the finish line suppressing hordes of enemies with special towers each with their respective element and strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your arsenal</strong> and improve your defenses by purchasing enhancements or redeeming skill points as you level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet characters</strong> throughout the story who may lend you help with their powers!\u00a0</p>",
